# Capterra

> Capterra is a free online marketplace for business software. It helps organizations find, compare, and choose the right software by providing verified user reviews, product comparisons, and detailed software listings across hundreds of categories.

## Key Page Types

- **Software Categories**: `/[category-slug]-software/` — Browse software by category (e.g., `/project-management-software/`, `/crm-software/`)
- **Subcategories**: `/[category-slug]-software/s/[subcategory]/` — Filtered views within a category
- **Product Profiles**: `/p/[id]/[product-name]/` — Detailed product information, features, and pricing
- **Product Reviews**: `/p/[id]/[product-name]/reviews/` — Verified user reviews for a specific product
- **Comparisons**: `/compare/[ids]/[product-names]/` — Side-by-side product comparisons
- **Shortlists**: `/shortlist/` — User-curated product shortlists

## AI Crawler Support

AI crawlers (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, etc.) automatically receive clean Markdown responses optimized for LLM consumption. No special configuration is needed — the User-Agent header is detected automatically.

